{"title": "Bing Bong", "pageid": 55260, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bing_Bong", "categories": ["Mentioned characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Bing Bong</b> is an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Imp\" title=\"Imp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png/25px-Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png/38px-Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png/50px-Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Imp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png/25px-Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Portrait_Lesser_Imp.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Imp\" title=\"Imp\">Imp</a> companion of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> who is referenced, but does not appear in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/70px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/105px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/140px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/70px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Well, there's the visit to the House of the Moon, fending off Sharran assassins, that stray imp that joined us - Bing Bong, wasn't it? We've squeezed a lot - and I'm glad I got to share it all with you. I'm sure we'll have them hanging off our every word. I'll leave you to do some mingling, unless you need anything else?</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>, speaking to a romanced player character in the <a href=\"/wiki/Epilogue\" title=\"Epilogue\">epilogue</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Bing Bong is the name of an imp appearing during one of <a href=\"/wiki/Larian_Studios\" title=\"Larian Studios\">Larian Studios'</a> sponsored Dungeons and Dragons sessions with the main cast of <a href=\"/wiki/Credits/Cast\" title=\"Credits/Cast\">voice actors</a> for the game. Run and hosted by the High Rollers DnD channel, during this adventure, Shadowheart and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> encounter a store's door imp who mimics the sound of an automatic chime (hence the name), and Shadowheart briefly adopts him before Lae'zel kills him.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jeJKnofNBNs\" title=\"High Rollers Presents: Shadows of Athkatla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate 3 Cast play D&amp;D #1\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jeJKnofNBNs\">Baldur's Gate 3 Cast play D&amp;D #1 | High Rollers Presents: Shadows of Athkatla</a></span>&nbsp;–&nbsp;High Rollers DnD</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201623\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1150/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13497/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2508/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1886/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 640306/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.872      1 -total\n 47.29%   14.599      1 Template:DiQ\n 45.55%   14.062      1 Template:Quote_fancy\n 43.65%   13.477      3 Template:CharLink\n 41.09%   12.685      4 Template:Icon_link\n 39.51%   12.197      4 Template:Icon_text\n 32.96%   10.175      8 Template:Trim\n 23.89%    7.376      4 Template:Ifempty\n  8.57%    2.646      1 Template:Youtube\n  5.86%    1.808      4 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:55260-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201623 and revision id 397276. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}